{"ID":"20240519170252-11xsxiv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240519170252-11xsxiv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519170252-11xsxiv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240520081425-byhws6w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240520081448-yqzqg5y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240520081448-yqzqg5y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"SARS.","type":"doc","updated":"20240520081448"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240520081425-byhws6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081425-byhws6w","updated":"20240520081428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"急迫性呼吸症候"}]},{"ID":"20240520081425-60s5inl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081425-60s5inl","updated":"20240520081444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目前台灣以及香港大陸流行的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"SARS"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome) , 實際上根本就是我們人類自己造成的瘟疫之類的傳染病 , 由於東南亞地區人口高度密集 , 飼養禽類只有生活在很小的空間裡 , 又由於屬於亞熱帶溫度及濕度過高 , 本就容易滋生病毒 , 畜牧業們為了賺錢 , 而不擇手段的大量使用抗生素 , 光是台灣一年就使用500噸抗生素以上 , 諸君試想 , 如此的濫用抗生素其結果如何 , 當然是令病毒抗藥性越來越強 , 直到有一天無法殺掉它 , 於是就開始恐慌 , 於是又想發明更強的抗生素來殺它 , 如此惡性循環下來 , 終有一日我們會毀滅在自己手上的 , 目前唯一的防治辦法就是使用中藥來排除此病毒於體外 , 此類病毒只能存活於體外約三小時左右 , 幾乎任何病毒都無法存活體外超過三小時的 .(請參閱台灣疾病防治局"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"SARS"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]},{"ID":"20240520081425-pt619eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081425-pt619eo","updated":"20240520081448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我按照目前台灣疾病防治局所公告的有關"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"SARS"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的醫學報告可知"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"此病中藥裡的大青龍湯可以治好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" , 因此我立即公開在我的網站上 , 希望大家傳開 , 免得冤枉的死於"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"SARS"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"."}]},{"ID":"20240520081425-26l620p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081425-26l620p","updated":"20240520081425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    請記取教訓 , 不要再濫用抗生素了 , 否則台灣必然會成為 \"瘟疫之島\"了 , 大家都死翹翹了 , 也不須要任何黨派了 , 也沒有人會來台灣觀光了 . 大陸也不須要來統一台灣了 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520081448-yqzqg5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081448-yqzqg5y"}}]}